DETAILED AGENT PROMPT — Credit (Unpaid) Card (A‑to‑Z: Design, UI, Logic, Inputs, Popups, JS)

Goal
Add a new “Credit (Unpaid)” card to the Delivery Calculation page. It must look consistent with the app, be compact, and integrate into totals. This card tracks unpaid amounts (credit) separately from expenses. Only this new card and its related logic are added; existing UI/logic remains unchanged.

Placement
Insert the Credit card directly after “Extra Expenses” card and before “Summary” card.

UI Structure (Exact)
Card title: “Credit (Unpaid)”
Table ID: creditTable
Columns: “Customer” | “Amount”
Add button: “+ Add Credit” (full width)
Total line: “Credit: ৳ <totalCredit>” aligned right

Input Rules
- Customer: text input (optional but recommended)
- Amount: number input (required, > 0)
- Each row has editable amount input; changes trigger recalculation
- Customer name should be visible and left aligned

Modal/Popup (Recommended)
Use a modal similar to Expense modal for adding credit items:
- Modal ID: creditModal
- Fields: Customer Name, Amount
- Buttons: Cancel, Save
- Validation: amount must be > 0 (customer can be empty)

Design Requirements
- Keep same card style: white background, rounded corners, soft shadow
- Table compact; font size 11px
- Inputs same style as others (border, radius, focus)
- Total row text bold

JavaScript Requirements
State:
- creditBody = document.querySelector('#creditTable tbody');

Functions:
1) addCredit() — open modal
2) closeCreditModal() — close modal
3) saveCreditFromModal() — validate input, append row
4) calcAll() — include credit total

Row Template
<tr>
	<td>Customer Name</td>
	<td><input type="number" value="amount"></td>
</tr>

Event Hooks
- On amount input change: calcAll()
- Add swipe‑to‑delete to credit rows (same pattern as expenses)

Calculation Logic Update
Existing net:
Net = Sales − Cash − Expenses

New net:
Net = Sales − Cash − Expenses − Credit

Totals:
- totalCredit = sum of credit amounts
- Display in credit card and in Summary (new row)

Summary Box Update
Add new summary row:
- “Total Credit:” ৳ <summaryCredit>
Update Net row accordingly.

Data Save (History)
When saving calculation:
- Add credit data array to calcObj:
	credit: [{ name, amount }]
- Add totalCredit to calcObj

When viewing/printing:
- Display credit section similar to expenses (optional but recommended)

When editing a saved calculation:
- Load credit rows into creditTable

Validation Messages
- If credit amount invalid: “Please enter a valid credit amount”

Acceptance Criteria
- Credit card UI matches app style
- Credit totals update live
- Net reflects credit
- Credit rows can be added/edited/deleted
- Saved history includes credit details

